    <h1 class="section__title">Carbilicon</h1>
    <p class="section__body">Noah Richardson — Psytrance and techno producer crafting intricate electronic soundscapes with Korg hardware. Known for hypnotic live performances and deep dives into vintage Goa trance culture.</p>
    <p class="section__body">Gear Explorer — Master of Korg Electribe ESX and EMX series, creating tutorials and demonstrations showcasing the depth of classic hardware samplers and synthesizers.</p>
